{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50246","headline":"投龙池 · 李翔","name":"投龙池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虎眼涡盘石窟中，古今俱向此投龙。\n奫沦不啻深千丈，肹（肸）蠁皆应到九重。\n洞穴昔闻通地府，风云今得遇灵踪。\n无因犯世间雷雨，池面连天拔一峰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李翔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50246.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50246","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}